  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While chasing Gu Liu Ru in the River of Time, a variant human Gu Immortal under Fang Yuan suggests activating torrential charge. Fang Yuan rejects the suggestion and orders daybreak sword instead.",
      "chapters": [
        1811
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gu_liu_ru",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Year Flying Warship activates torrential charge beneath it with daybreak swords around it; the silver swords pierce into the torrent and explode with an unimaginable speed. Li Huang is shocked that the two moves can be combined. The warship then collides into the damaged Shark Flow Lever and destroys it, continuing into Li Huang with remaining momentum.",
      "chapters": [
        1812
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combined-rush",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship",
        "char_li_huang",
        "house_shark_flow_lever"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Year Flying Warship has four main killer moves: torrential charge, daybreak sword, daybreak torrent, and myriad year hunting, each a rank eight move. Outside the River of Time, without that environment’s amplification, the warship’s killer moves only have normal strength.",
      "chapters": [
        1872
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "warship-kit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When leaving a clash with Thousand Transformations Ancestor, Fang Yuan activates torrential charge; shining water waves appear below the warship as a phantom image of the River of Time, and the warship borrows the river’s momentum and leaves like a shot arrow.",
      "chapters": [
        1873
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "leave-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Named activation against Heavenly Court in the River of Time.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan gathers silver flying swords in the water below and activates Immortal killer move Torrential Charge; Myriad Year Flying Warship shoots out like a meteor and crashes into the river suppression lotus sealing formation still being set up. Moment Stage blocks it; the two rank eight Immortal Gu Houses collide, Moment Stage takes a slight disadvantage, and the warship’s advance is halted as Shark Flow Lever and Three Autumn Yellow Crane Platform catch up.",
      "chapters": [
        1882
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_moment_stage",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_three_autumn_yellow_crane_platform"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court later counters exposed methods such as daybreak sword, torrential charge, and myriad year hunting after analyzing them.",
